# Nishi-Shinjuku: lantern-lit alleys with yakitori smoke.

[props]
░ ░
● ◘
● ◘
║ ║

[legend]
░ = grey70
● = red3
◘ = $lamp
║ = tan

[captions]
Smoke from the yakitori grills drifts out of the narrow alleys.
Red lanterns hang over alleys barely wide enough for one person.
Salarymen squeeze onto tiny stools along the counters of the alleys.
